  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 4905.02 Requirements for Renewal of Certification",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4905.02 Requirements for Renewal of Certification.\n\n(a) For the purposes of this section, “technical instruction” means instruction or training relevant to any certificate issued by this chapter.\n\n(b) A certificate holder shall renew his/her certificate by submitting the following to the state fire marshal’s office:\n\n(1) A completed form DSFM 87;\n\n(2) The applicable fee; and\n\n(3) Evidence of successful completion of a minimum of 8 hours of technical instruction during the previous 24 months.\n\n(c) For the purposes of (b)(1), a certificate holder applicant shall:\n\n(1) Comply with Saf-C 4904.02; and\n\n(2) Supply on DSFM 87 the certificate number of the last certificate issued pursuant to these rules.\n\nSource. #8650, eff 6-2-06; amd by #9766-A, eff 8-3-10",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c4900.html"
